    "groundingSupports": [
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 84,
       "endIndex": 124,
       "text": "** You should **negotiate aggressively**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 242,
       "endIndex": 489,
       "text": "While this is a respectable opening offer for a Google L6 Product Manager, it is essentially a **lateral financial move** from Meta IC6 and does not provide enough of a premium to justify walking away from your current unvested equity and momentum"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 531,
       "endIndex": 594,
       "text": "At Google L6 in the Bay Area, this offer breaks down as follows"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 748,
       "endIndex": 846,
       "text": "| **Annual Bonus** | 20% ($47,000 target) | Standard across all L6 PMs (non-negotiable percentage)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 920,
       "endIndex": 981,
       "text": "Solid mid-tier, but well below top-of-band (~$1.25M\u2013$1.4M+)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1027,
       "endIndex": 1098,
       "text": "** Poaching an IC6 from Meta typically warrants a $50k\u2013$100k+ sign-on"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1102,
       "endIndex": 1172,
       "text": "| **Annualized TC** | **~$552,000/yr** (flat avg) | Mid-band for L6 PM"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1265,
       "endIndex": 1426,
       "text": "Google generally uses a front-loaded vesting model (typically **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** or **38% / 32% / 20% / 10%**) rather than Meta\u2019s flat 25%/year schedule"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1430,
       "endIndex": 1467,
       "text": "**Year 1:** ~$640,000 \u2013 $690,000 TC"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1470,
       "endIndex": 1507,
       "text": "**Year 2:** ~$580,000 \u2013 $630,000 TC"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1510,
       "endIndex": 1547,
       "text": "**Year 3:** ~$470,000 \u2013 $500,000 TC"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1550,
       "endIndex": 1587,
       "text": "**Year 4:** ~$360,000 \u2013 $390,000 TC"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1589,
       "endIndex": 1666,
       "text": "While Year 1 looks strong, you face a **steep equity cliff in Years 3 and 4**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1668,
       "endIndex": 1762,
       "text": "Unless performance refreshers are exceptionally high, your compensation will decline over time"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1820,
       "endIndex": 1987,
       "text": "**Bonus Multipliers:** Meta\u2019s company and individual performance multipliers often yield cash payouts well above the 20% baseline (frequently 125%\u2013150%+ of target)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1989,
       "endIndex": 2049,
       "text": "Google\u2019s bonus payouts tend to stick much closer to target"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2053,
       "endIndex": 2205,
       "text": "**Stacked Refreshers:** If you have been at Meta for 2+ years, your stacked quarterly refreshers are likely already delivering substantial annual equity"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2517,
       "endIndex": 2572,
       "text": "Google commonly uses sign-on bonuses to bridge this gap"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2653,
       "endIndex": 2797,
       "text": "This brings your annualized stock to ~$320k\u2013$340k/yr, ensuring Years 3 and 4 remain competitive after the front-loaded initial vest tapers off"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3033,
       "endIndex": 3172,
       "text": "Communicate that while you were impressed by the team, the numbers currently do not offset the trajectory and stacked comp you have at Meta"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4054,
       "endIndex": 4089,
       "text": "**Do not accept** the initial offer"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4093,
       "endIndex": 4160,
       "text": "**Negotiate** for an $80k+ sign-on, ~$1.3M equity, and ~$255k+ base"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4164,
       "endIndex": 4309,
       "text": "**Walk away** if Google refuses to bridge the gap\u2014your compensation growth at Meta as an established IC6 will likely outpace this current offer"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       1
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
